      "message": "Hi Gil,\n\nI think there may be a misunderstanding here. My understanding was that we would reuse `libdiced_open_dice_nostd` as a crate and incorporate it by adding some make rules like this:\n\n```\nMODULE_LIBRARY_DEPS +\u003d \\\n\t$(call FIND_CRATE,diced_open_dice_nostd)\n```\n\nThis approach would be preferable to recreating the compilation process and introducing another variant of open-dice. We already have over 5 upstream open-dice variations and 3 different wrapper libraries in AOSP. Adding another wrapper library would only increase the maintenance burden, which I\u0027d prefer to avoid if possible.",
